WEBVTT

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.540
but at the end of the day it was the core

00:15:01.564 --> 00:15:04.158
and how the organization behaved

00:15:04.182 --> 00:15:06.784
that would ultimately shape the culture.

00:15:06.808 --> 00:15:09.199
And companies who are looking to try

00:15:09.223 --> 00:15:13.627
to bring cultural lightning rods
to the organization

00:15:13.651 --> 00:15:16.222
would bring a whole group into a WeWork,

00:15:16.246 --> 00:15:17.563
because it was so different

00:15:17.587 --> 00:15:20.539
from whatever their corporate
environment was.

00:15:20.563 --> 00:15:25.283
So we would be used as a bit of a lever
for cultural change.

00:15:26.044 --> 00:15:30.763
So I think we were helping inform culture.